  "photo-caption": "<p>We are (somewhat more) open again! Why don’t you come over and 3D print something, use the mini lathe that got its full maintenance or use our welder that has just got a new hose package? </p><p>For now <b>7 people will be allowed at the Munich Maker Lab </b>at the same time and <b>we are finally open to guests </b>(after they sign our COVID ToS) again! We would be more than happy to see you at the Space. </p><p>Got questions? Reach out to us via Instagram, the mailing list or simply stop by 😍</p>",
